      "summary": "This area answers a person's question using their own authorized documents, streaming the answer back live so text appears as it is written. Every claim is checked against the cited passages, and unusable or unverifiable answers are replaced with clear messages instead of invented text. Completed answers are saved privately per user and re-checked on later viewing, so withdrawn source access hides the old answer.",
