      "summary": "This area measures how good the search is. It loads versioned test bundles whose files are hash-checked, prepares each bundle into its own isolated search index, asks every test question in four search styles, compares the ranked results against human relevance labels, and writes repeatable JSON and Markdown reports. A command-line tool builds the SciFact test set. It is a command-line tool, not a service; the old debug web route is retired, and database tables for runs exist but nothing yet moves a run beyond 'queued'.",
      "api_calls_last_update": 7
    },
