      "source_revision": "e4abb88a149b365c2838b0f2f0606dff0127b1ab",
      "summary": "This area is the shared foundation of a multi-tenant document search service. It starts the web application with health and readiness checks, handles errors and request tracking uniformly, decides who may do what using a demo-identity login scheme backed by real database permissions, and stores uploaded documents with duplicate detection and safe deletion. The main inputs are incoming web requests plus an uploaded file; the useful results are authorized access, a stored document record with a status, and database schema helper commands for local development.",
      "api_calls_last_update": 3
    },
